  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Idasa-GAP is a regional NGO whose mission is to promote sustainable democratic governance. The objectives of the program are to:  - consolidate the Idasa-GAP regional network  - strengthen partners&apos; HIV&amp;AIDS resource tracking skills  - strengthen citizen agency   -promote public discussion on governance and HIV&amp;AIDS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Idasa-GAP &#xE4;r en regional organisation vars uppdrag &#xE4;r att fr&#xE4;mja en h&#xE5;llbar demokratisk samh&#xE4;llsstyrning. M&#xE5;len f&#xF6;r programmet &#xE4;r att: - Konsolidera Idasa-GAP regionalt n&#xE4;tverk  - St&#xE4;rka partners HIV &amp; AIDS resurs sp&#xE5;rning f&#xE4;rdigheter  - St&#xE4;rka medborgarnas byr&#xE5;   -fr&#xE4;mja en offentlig diskussion om styrning och HIV &amp; AIDS</narrative>
  </description>
